# The call-site locator from issue #28: two build scripts that never call each
# other, coupled through one file. Rendered for anthropic-design and apple-design.
#
# Source of truth for those figures. Do not hand-edit the SVG; edit this and run
#   python3 skills/design-review/scripts/gen_call_site_figure.py
# Format: skills/design-review/references/callsites/README.md

id: build-manifest
title: CALL-SITE LOCATOR · WHY THE BUILD STOPS AT ONE LINE | 调用链定位 · 构建为什么停在这一行
subtitle: every level carries a file:line · the deciding lines are read from the file, never retyped | 每一层都挂 file:line · 决定结局的那几行从文件里读出来，不手抄
couple: ship_manifest.txt
couple.note: produced by one chain, required by the other | 一条链产出，另一条链要用
foot: grep finds neither end of the coupling: the two chains share a filename, not a call. | grep 找不到这道耦合的任何一端：两条链共用的是一个文件名，不是一次调用。

chain: Packaging · part of every full build | 打包 · 每次完整构建都会跑
main()                      build.sh:34
  pack_release_archive()    build.sh:37    @removed   -- cut from main() for a faster debug build | 为了让调试构建快一点，从 main() 里删掉了
    copy_manifest()         build.sh:30    -- its own private step | 它自己的私有步骤
      > build.sh:25    share=ship_manifest.txt
      ! nothing else puts the manifest in $OUT_DIR | 清单进 $OUT_DIR 只有这一条通道

chain: Verification · runs after the build, never calls packaging | 验收 · 构建完才跑，从不调用打包
CI job "verify"             - outside this repo · run by CI | 仓库外 · 由 CI 启动
  verify_all()              verify_all.sh:21    -- every post-build check | 构建后的全部检查
    check_coverage()        verify_all.sh:17    -- one of three checks | 三道检查之一
      find_manifest()       check_coverage.sh:14    @focus    -- the line you came here for | 你要找的就是这一行
        > check_coverage.sh:6-9    mark=return 1    share=*manifest*.txt
        ! no manifest → return 1, and every caller passes it up | 找不到清单就 return 1，每一层调用方都原样往上交
  ^ CI job "verify" = exit 1 : the job fails and the build goes red | job 失败，构建标红
